    <item>
      <title>2.6.7</title>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[
          <ul>
            <li>New built-in action "Reveal in Finder": copy a local path — a folder opens in Finder, a file is selected inside its folder.</li>
            <li>Accepts absolute and ~/ paths, file:// URLs and copied Finder items.</li>
          </ul>
        ]]>
